WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 36=

02:13.620 --> 02:14.547
(I have borne our ancestors' burden
for 41 years.)

02:14.548 --> 02:15.660
(I took office young, but corrected
my faults, growing more cautious.)

02:19.640 --> 02:22.640
My father plans to pass
the throne to Mu Xun?

02:28.250 --> 02:29.850
The Crown Prince was deposed
and confined.

02:31.570 --> 02:34.010
Yet you're the son His Majesty summons
time and again.

02:34.970 --> 02:36.010
Do you think Mu Xun

02:36.850 --> 02:37.410
will let you go

02:38.810 --> 02:40.090
once he takes the throne?

02:43.010 --> 02:43.920
Given the Crown Prince's nature,

02:45.320 --> 02:46.570
even if my father never summoned me,

02:47.570 --> 02:49.160
he'd never let me go.

02:50.410 --> 02:50.720
Your Highness.

02:52.130 --> 02:53.640
His Majesty knows his days are numbered,

02:54.160 --> 02:55.480
so he had me draft this edict

02:55.850 --> 02:57.250
and hide it in his chamber.

02:58.090 --> 02:58.920
The moment

02:59.640 --> 03:01.600
His Majesty sends this decree

03:01.880 --> 03:03.410
to the Chancellery,

03:04.160 --> 03:04.850
there'll be

03:05.850 --> 03:07.810
no turning back.

03:10.370 --> 03:11.410
Mr. Liu, please save me.

03:13.200 --> 03:14.440
If I didn't want to help you,

03:15.090 --> 03:17.090
I wouldn't have come today,
Your Highness.

03:17.570 --> 03:17.850
Here.

03:21.600 --> 03:22.200
But

03:23.040 --> 03:24.640
do you really want to
turn things around?

03:26.010 --> 03:27.640
More than anything.

03:28.090 --> 03:29.250
I want to live!

03:30.440 --> 03:31.040
Then

03:33.440 --> 03:34.850
you'll have to do something big.

03:47.320 --> 03:47.760
Your Highness.

03:48.720 --> 03:49.850
May I borrow your writing implements?

04:05.530 --> 04:07.640
Why did His Majesty suddenly summon me?

04:07.850 --> 04:09.290
Chancellor Liu,
you'd best ask His Majesty yourself.

04:09.880 --> 04:10.850
I'm just a palace eunuch.

04:14.160 --> 04:14.690
Summon

04:15.090 --> 04:16.050
the Vice Chief of the Secretariat,

04:16.250 --> 04:16.930
the Chief of the Secretariat,

04:17.320 --> 04:18.280
the Vice Chief of the Chancellery,

04:18.440 --> 04:19.250
the Supervising Secretary,

04:19.520 --> 04:20.810
and the Left and Right
Grand Remonstrants

04:21.080 --> 04:22.130
to the palace at once.

04:22.810 --> 04:25.250
I have urgent matters
to discuss with you all in private.

04:25.690 --> 04:28.320
No delay. Let no word leak out!

04:35.080 --> 04:36.960
What... what's going on?

04:38.170 --> 04:38.570
(Universe in Harmony)
Look.

04:38.730 --> 04:39.050
This is...?

04:45.130 --> 04:46.610
His Majesty's condition
has suddenly worsened.

04:47.200 --> 04:48.050
The last edict has been issued.

04:48.280 --> 04:48.960
The last edict?

04:49.520 --> 04:50.250
Hear the edict.

04:51.400 --> 04:52.520
Without the Secretariat and Chancellery,

04:53.280 --> 04:54.250
how can this be called an edict?

04:54.640 --> 04:55.080
Exactly.

04:55.760 --> 04:57.050
Does the Princess Regent know?

04:57.640 --> 04:59.280
Where is Chancellor Liu?

04:59.840 --> 05:00.379
- Exactly!
- Right!

05:00.421 --> 05:01.039
We want to see Chancellor Liu!

05:01.081 --> 05:01.819
Where is Chancellor Liu?

05:01.861 --> 05:02.829
We must see Chancellor Liu!

05:02.870 --> 05:04.159
- We want to see Chancellor Liu!
- Let us see Chancellor Liu!

05:04.201 --> 05:04.869
Who do you think you are?

05:04.911 --> 05:05.721
Let us see Chancellor Liu!

05:06.010 --> 05:06.930
Outrageous!

05:08.960 --> 05:10.400
- Let us see Chancellor Liu!
- We want to see Chancellor Liu!

05:10.840 --> 05:11.669
Who do you think you are?

05:11.710 --> 05:12.529
We'll hear what Chancellor Liu says!

05:12.571 --> 05:13.229
Let us see Chancellor Liu!

05:13.271 --> 05:13.799
Bring Chancellor Liu out!

05:13.841 --> 05:14.471
We want to see Chancellor Liu!

05:15.280 --> 05:16.080
Bring Chancellor Liu out!

06:34.340 --> 06:36.980
(The empire teeters on the brink.
The Prince of Jin usurps the throne.)

07:03.740 --> 07:08.780
(Weizhou, Hanbei Circuit,
Border of Hanbei)

07:20.440 --> 07:21.610
Weizhou is just ahead.

07:22.080 --> 07:22.440
Ruozhu,

07:22.960 --> 07:24.810
we can stop in the city for a day

07:25.080 --> 07:25.690
to celebrate your birthday.

07:27.370 --> 07:27.840
Dear.

07:28.640 --> 07:29.170
Wait.

07:33.250 --> 07:33.730
What's wrong?

07:34.250 --> 07:36.200
I'm sure I heard
the evening drum marking the You hour.

07:37.490 --> 07:39.250
Why are the city gates still open?

07:39.930 --> 07:41.170
Maybe we're lucky

07:41.640 --> 07:43.490
and can get in to rest today.

08:04.810 --> 08:05.440
Dear.

08:06.810 --> 08:07.370
What's wrong?

08:11.840 --> 08:12.760
(Weizhou)
Weizhou has fallen.

08:13.490 --> 08:14.690
The longer we keep the news under wraps,

08:15.250 --> 08:16.840
the better our chances.

08:17.200 --> 08:18.170
Now we join forces

08:19.250 --> 08:20.080
and march day and night

08:20.840 --> 08:21.520
straight for Sheng'an.

08:22.170 --> 08:22.610
Let's go.

08:29.440 --> 08:30.730
Something this big happened in Weizhou.

08:31.400 --> 08:32.450
Why no beacon smoke?

08:33.250 --> 08:34.040
If that's the case,

08:35.010 --> 08:36.400
it may not be
just one prefecture that's fallen.

08:37.400 --> 08:38.520
It may be the entire Hanbei Circuit.

08:40.560 --> 08:42.490
We need to get word
to the neighboring prefectures fast.

08:42.920 --> 08:43.800
If war breaks out again,

08:44.040 --> 08:44.640
Weizhou

08:45.130 --> 08:46.280
and Hanbei Circuit won't be

08:46.640 --> 08:47.490
the only places affected.

08:48.130 --> 08:49.640
Since they've killed
all the city guards,

08:50.130 --> 08:51.760
the beacon tower officers and men

08:52.730 --> 08:53.920
must be dead too.

08:56.130 --> 08:56.850
What do we do?

09:05.210 --> 09:06.010
There's a small path here.

09:06.490 --> 09:07.400
We can go around this way

09:07.760 --> 09:08.880
and get there half a day sooner.

09:12.520 --> 09:13.250
Why is there a beacon fire?

09:13.730 --> 09:14.250
(Wang Chengding, Hanbei Military Governor)
Who lit it?

09:14.640 --> 09:15.010
General.

09:15.330 --> 09:16.450
We've wiped out the beacon guards.

09:16.730 --> 09:17.610
The wolf dung's been cleared out too.

09:18.370 --> 09:19.330
(Tan Yuanchun, Handong Military Governor)
I'll take some men back to check.

09:29.250 --> 09:30.520
We've burned so many books.

09:31.090 --> 09:32.730
Can the people in the neighboring
prefectures see the flames?

09:35.130 --> 09:36.560
Bamboo slips are no match
for firewood and wolf dung.

09:37.090 --> 09:38.800
Let's burn more, and faster.

09:41.210 --> 09:42.450
We've carried these all this way.

09:42.970 --> 09:43.640
Scroll by scroll.

09:44.130 --> 09:44.760
Box by box.

09:45.370 --> 09:45.970
Today,

09:46.610 --> 09:48.010
they've finally served their purpose.

09:48.760 --> 09:49.970
Books are only things, after all.

09:50.280 --> 09:52.640
Once printed, their words will live on
for generations.

09:53.520 --> 09:54.730
We can always collect more later.

09:57.280 --> 09:57.779
Hurry! Over here!

09:57.821 --> 09:58.351
- Ruozhu!
- They're here!

09:58.450 --> 09:58.739
This way!

09:58.781 --> 09:59.151
Hurry!

10:01.460 --> 10:04.110
♪I ride through endless sands
without rest♪

10:04.160 --> 10:04.560
Ruozhu.

10:05.280 --> 10:06.880
To have known you in this life,

10:07.800 --> 10:08.800
I can die without regret.

10:10.040 --> 10:11.130
We'll walk the road

10:11.172 --> 10:13.490
♪Frost stains my sleeves;
the setting sun lights towers♪

10:15.040 --> 10:16.130
to the underworld together.

10:16.172 --> 10:18.320
♪Wild geese fly south
through late autumn♪

10:18.920 --> 10:21.400
♪May the endless wind linger for me♪

10:21.450 --> 10:23.450
I wondered
who had caused all this trouble.

10:24.090 --> 10:25.880
Just two commoners.

10:26.490 --> 10:27.610
Not afraid to die, are you?

10:27.652 --> 10:30.960
♪Let the storms sweep the hills bare;
still, I cling to dreams of home♪

10:31.010 --> 10:31.610
We dared to

10:31.890 --> 10:33.710
♪If one day my homeland calls,
my heart stays true♪

10:33.760 --> 10:35.330
light the beacon fire here today

10:36.760 --> 10:38.280
knowing you'd find us,

10:39.640 --> 10:41.370
and knowing we'd die here!

10:41.412 --> 10:45.060
♪Whose eyes have seen the smoke of war?♪

10:45.110 --> 10:47.400
♪I'll ride into battle♪

10:47.450 --> 10:47.880
Lin Dao.

10:49.040 --> 10:49.490
Lin Dao?

10:50.640 --> 10:51.010
Lin Dao!

10:51.052 --> 10:52.450
♪Blood stains my sleeves as
I stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

10:54.280 --> 10:54.880
Lin Dao.

10:55.800 --> 10:56.370
Lin Dao.

10:56.412 --> 10:57.260
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

10:57.320 --> 11:00.250
♪May you live a life free of sorrow♪

11:01.610 --> 11:02.610
What are you waiting for?

11:02.652 --> 11:03.960
♪May the moon shine on us forever♪

11:04.010 --> 11:05.450
Kill me already!

11:09.130 --> 11:10.280
You're...?

11:16.520 --> 11:17.730
Chancellor Liu once did me a favor.

11:18.280 --> 11:18.850
I won't kill you.

11:19.090 --> 11:20.450
I know your voice.

11:22.520 --> 11:23.730
Tan Yuanchun.

11:25.040 --> 11:28.280
Why put on this show of compassion?

11:30.970 --> 11:31.680
Leave a squad behind.

11:32.450 --> 11:33.520
Put out that beacon fire at once.

11:39.610 --> 11:40.250
Lin Dao.

11:42.420 --> 11:47.058
(County Office)

11:47.100 --> 11:51.790
(County Office)

11:51.850 --> 11:52.730
Yang Si is ridiculous.

11:55.210 --> 11:56.400
Still drinking and not back yet.

11:57.040 --> 11:58.210
Does he not want to go back to Sheng'an?

12:04.760 --> 12:05.210
Yan Shang.

12:06.490 --> 12:07.040
Look north.

12:08.970 --> 12:09.560
What's that?

12:13.920 --> 12:14.680
A beacon fire.

12:15.370 --> 12:16.250
Coming from Hanbei Circuit.

12:20.330 --> 12:21.210
How many men do you have?

12:21.730 --> 12:22.680
We need to find Yang Si fast.

12:23.280 --> 12:24.040
If he comes back to your place...

12:28.400 --> 12:28.800
No.

12:31.160 --> 12:32.130
He didn't lose track of time.

12:33.160 --> 12:34.040
He left on purpose.

12:35.610 --> 12:36.640
So that beacon fire

12:37.210 --> 12:38.210
has to do with the deposed Crown Prince?

12:39.730 --> 12:40.760
I have to get back to Sheng'an at once.

12:41.090 --> 12:41.450
Wait.

12:48.760 --> 12:49.680
If Yang Si is compromised,

12:50.090 --> 12:52.250
then the attendants you brought
can't be trusted either.

12:53.560 --> 12:54.970
Should I report this
to the prefecture first?

12:55.330 --> 12:56.160
Our Military Governor

12:56.450 --> 12:58.640
may be able to
hold off Hanbei Circuit for a while.

12:59.520 --> 12:59.850
No.

13:01.450 --> 13:03.040
I knew the generals of both circuits.

13:04.160 --> 13:05.330
The Military Governor of Hannan Circuit

13:05.560 --> 13:07.090
has always been closely allied
with Hanbei.

13:08.010 --> 13:09.280
If Wang Chengding of Hanbei rebels,

13:09.730 --> 13:10.880
it'll be a blessing if Hannan

13:11.250 --> 13:12.010
doesn't join him.

13:15.760 --> 13:16.130
Yan Shang.

13:16.680 --> 13:17.250
We must hurry.

13:37.210 --> 13:37.680
Lin Dao.

13:39.210 --> 13:39.760
Lin Dao.

13:45.210 --> 13:47.160
You scared me to death.

13:49.850 --> 13:50.880
Sorry to worry you.

14:13.100 --> 14:15.740
(Ancient Chu Musical Scores)

14:17.330 --> 14:19.560
Why do you carry bamboo slips with you?

14:21.160 --> 14:23.210
They took the brunt
of the arrow for you.

14:26.850 --> 14:28.040
Ancient Chu Musical Scores.

14:29.560 --> 14:30.040
I was going to

14:31.280 --> 14:32.730
surprise you with them.

14:33.450 --> 14:33.970
Tomorrow

14:35.370 --> 14:36.490
is your birthday.

14:45.880 --> 14:46.560
All right.

15:20.560 --> 15:21.400
Who goes there?

15:39.370 --> 15:40.090
Wait for me.

15:41.730 --> 15:42.349
Don't run.

15:42.391 --> 15:43.511
Get home quick.

15:43.610 --> 15:44.370
Slow down.

15:45.490 --> 15:46.899
Come take a look!

15:46.941 --> 15:48.941
Hot steamed buns.

15:49.490 --> 15:52.010
Fresh out of the steamer.

15:53.370 --> 15:54.490
Come take a look!

15:55.730 --> 15:56.560
What would you like?

15:58.880 --> 16:00.160
Come take a look.

16:01.400 --> 16:02.130
Take care.

16:02.330 --> 16:03.010
Greens.

16:05.040 --> 16:06.160
Fresh greens.

16:14.680 --> 16:15.970
(Wang's Tea Shop, Plain Silk Shop)
Very fresh!

16:41.800 --> 16:42.760
Why were you following me?

16:43.450 --> 16:46.210
Someone important sent me
to deliver this to you.

17:13.490 --> 17:14.450
(The empire is on the brink.)

17:15.360 --> 17:17.450
(I've secretly summoned
Tan Yuanchun of Handong Circuit)

17:18.250 --> 17:19.560
(and Wang Chengding of Hanbei Circuit)

17:20.080 --> 17:20.930
(to rise and support me.)

17:22.280 --> 17:23.120
(When you see this letter,)

17:24.650 --> 17:26.840
(if you still remember the years
we rode side by side)

17:27.890 --> 17:29.600
(and pity my desperate plight,)

17:30.970 --> 17:31.800
(go to Hanbei at once)

17:33.040 --> 17:34.490
(to meet Tan and Wang's cavalry)

17:35.010 --> 17:36.040
(and march west toward Sheng'an.)

17:37.650 --> 17:38.520
(If it's too hard for you,)

17:38.890 --> 17:39.730
(then forget it.)

17:40.040 --> 17:42.010
(I won't blame you.)

17:42.760 --> 17:43.690
(Two beacon fires)

17:44.650 --> 17:45.650
(will soon be lit.)

17:46.600 --> 17:48.360
(You must leave
that dangerous place at once.)

17:50.040 --> 17:51.120
(Fate closes in.)

17:51.760 --> 17:52.210
(I)

17:52.600 --> 17:53.690
(have no other way.)

17:55.840 --> 17:57.690
(And I must act on my own.)

17:59.410 --> 18:00.410
(The jade pendant enclosed)

18:01.280 --> 18:03.010
(is the one I wore when we hunted
together at the Shangsi Festival.)

18:03.800 --> 18:04.760
(It stands in my stead.)

18:05.560 --> 18:06.410
(Please take care.)

18:35.600 --> 18:36.360
The jade pendant here

18:36.970 --> 18:37.890
is as good as the Crown Prince himself.

18:41.080 --> 18:41.600
Rise, both of you.

18:44.040 --> 18:44.800
This pendant is the proof.

18:45.600 --> 18:46.800
His Royal Highness has put me in charge
of this campaign

18:47.360 --> 18:49.250
and ordered me to meet your troops
and march west toward Sheng'an.

18:50.800 --> 18:51.560
It's come to this.

18:52.600 --> 18:53.250
No turning back now.

18:53.800 --> 18:54.490
No room for error.

18:55.360 --> 18:56.890
His Royal Highness has entrusted us
with his life.

18:57.250 --> 18:58.170
We'll do our utmost.

18:58.930 --> 18:59.280
Generals,

19:00.080 --> 19:01.600
we are not to lay siege to cities
or engage in battle.

19:02.650 --> 19:04.010
Avoid any obstacles along the way
whenever possible.

19:04.360 --> 19:05.210
Travel light.

19:05.560 --> 19:06.930
Reach Tongguan within ten days.

19:08.490 --> 19:10.210
And keep your soldiers in line.

19:11.970 --> 19:12.560
Those who delay will be

19:13.360 --> 19:13.650
executed.

19:14.170 --> 19:15.010
Those who leak word will be

19:15.800 --> 19:16.120
executed.

19:16.650 --> 19:17.450
Those who shrink back will be

19:18.280 --> 19:18.600
executed!

19:19.840 --> 19:22.120
Generals, I hope we will work together
with one purpose.

19:23.450 --> 19:23.890
- Yes!
- Yes!

19:27.410 --> 19:28.040
There's one more thing

19:28.840 --> 19:30.170
you need to know.

19:32.120 --> 19:33.760
The Princess Regent left the capital
with me in disguise.

19:34.320 --> 19:35.730
She's currently within Lanyang County.

19:36.250 --> 19:37.010
Route the two armies around.

19:38.120 --> 19:39.080
Do not disturb her.

19:44.080 --> 19:45.080
Rest assured.

19:45.690 --> 19:46.970
His Royal Highness knows
this puts you in a hard spot.

19:47.730 --> 19:49.490
Yesterday, he secretly ordered me
to send an elite force

19:50.800 --> 19:51.210
to capture

19:51.840 --> 19:52.560
Princess Danyang.

19:53.930 --> 19:54.490
What?

19:57.320 --> 19:57.890
(Lanyang County Office)
Search everywhere!

19:58.360 --> 19:58.989
Yes, sir!

19:59.031 --> 20:00.749
Search every room thoroughly!

20:00.791 --> 20:01.481
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

20:01.970 --> 20:02.730
You guys, over there!

20:03.410 --> 20:04.080
You, go that way!

20:04.250 --> 20:04.600
Yes, sir!

20:05.040 --> 20:05.800
Search carefully!

20:06.760 --> 20:07.280
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

20:08.250 --> 20:09.560
Everyone keep your eyes peeled!

20:09.930 --> 20:11.320
Search every corner carefully!

20:11.760 --> 20:12.019
Yes, sir!

20:12.061 --> 20:12.781
Search carefully!

20:13.010 --> 20:13.320
Hurry!

20:14.080 --> 20:14.760
Nothing, sir.

20:15.250 --> 20:15.600
Nothing!

20:17.890 --> 20:19.450
Sir, we've searched everywhere. Nothing.

20:21.520 --> 20:22.930
Seal the city gates. No one in or out!

20:23.450 --> 20:24.450
We must find them!

20:24.840 --> 20:25.320
Yes, sir!

20:25.490 --> 20:25.760
Move!

20:31.360 --> 20:31.730
(Donglang,)

20:32.650 --> 20:33.250
(after I leave,)

20:33.560 --> 20:35.080
(go take shelter at the charity school)

20:35.520 --> 20:36.280
(at once.)

20:37.040 --> 20:37.520
Mr. Yan,

20:38.170 --> 20:39.040
please stay safe.

20:48.730 --> 20:49.490
Once we're over this mountain,

20:49.800 --> 20:51.410
we'll reach the main road,
and we can ride from there.

20:52.560 --> 20:54.650
How do you know roads like this?

20:55.010 --> 20:55.800
Thanks to you,

20:56.360 --> 20:57.760
I've been here for three years.

20:58.360 --> 21:00.320
I know every hill and stream
like the back of my hand.

21:01.210 --> 21:01.690
Almost there.

21:02.040 --> 21:02.840
The trail down is just ahead.

21:04.450 --> 21:05.250
Surround the woods!

21:05.650 --> 21:06.410
Search every inch!

21:06.890 --> 21:07.450
Report anything unusual

21:07.650 --> 21:08.250
at once!

21:08.450 --> 21:09.170
Yes, sir!

21:11.320 --> 21:12.120
They've sealed off the mountain.

21:13.250 --> 21:14.210
My brother

21:15.080 --> 21:16.520
has always been ruthless.

21:17.840 --> 21:18.930
Sure enough, he won't let me

21:19.560 --> 21:20.970
make it back to Sheng'an alive.

21:58.760 --> 22:00.080
Who's there at this hour?

22:00.360 --> 22:01.320
We're just passing through.

22:01.600 --> 22:02.650
We need your help.

22:06.800 --> 22:07.410
Sir.

22:11.730 --> 22:12.930
Who are you looking for?

22:13.650 --> 22:15.650
We got lost in the mountains.

22:16.320 --> 22:17.410
We're hoping to stay the night.

22:22.490 --> 22:23.210
Come... come in.

22:23.730 --> 22:24.210
Thank you.

22:24.320 --> 22:24.730
Thank you.

22:36.560 --> 22:37.840
Are you two husband and wife?

22:38.840 --> 22:39.189
Yes.

22:39.231 --> 22:39.621
No.

22:46.490 --> 22:47.320
To be honest,

22:48.170 --> 22:49.210
we

22:49.730 --> 22:51.320
are not married yet.

22:52.040 --> 22:53.250
But we're already engaged.

22:55.210 --> 22:56.970
My father is a snob.

22:57.080 --> 22:57.930
He wants to break it off.

22:58.760 --> 22:59.970
So we ran away.

23:00.760 --> 23:02.010
We didn't dare take the official road,

23:02.410 --> 23:03.730
so we tried the mountain paths.

23:04.690 --> 23:05.520
But we got lost.

23:07.210 --> 23:07.730
Sir.

23:08.250 --> 23:09.120
We'll leave at dawn.

23:09.320 --> 23:10.410
We won't trouble you.

23:11.210 --> 23:11.760
But

23:12.280 --> 23:13.080
if anyone asks,

23:13.650 --> 23:15.650
please say you never saw us.

23:15.970 --> 23:16.450
Yes.

23:17.080 --> 23:17.930
If we're caught,

23:18.210 --> 23:19.360
my father will beat me to death.

23:20.450 --> 23:21.280
Helping someone in need

23:21.730 --> 23:22.930
is a good deed.

23:34.360 --> 23:35.730
Please take this money.

23:36.010 --> 23:37.080
For letting us stay the night.

23:37.840 --> 23:38.490
Put it away.

23:38.800 --> 23:39.690
We can't take this.

23:39.890 --> 23:40.760
We can't.

23:41.040 --> 23:42.560
Alright. Have a seat.

23:42.800 --> 23:43.280
Come on, sit.

23:43.970 --> 23:44.450
Have a seat.

23:47.210 --> 23:47.490
I...

23:47.600 --> 23:48.210
Let's go.

23:48.450 --> 23:49.010
Let's get dinner ready.

23:49.120 --> 23:50.170
- No, I was just...
- Those two kids must be

23:50.250 --> 23:51.360
starving and exhausted.

23:51.690 --> 23:52.490
Let's get dinner ready.

24:04.040 --> 24:05.080
You're quite the liar.

24:08.040 --> 24:08.890
They've sealed off the mountain.

24:09.490 --> 24:10.170
Now they'll search it.

24:11.600 --> 24:13.690
Who knows how far they'll get tonight?

24:17.890 --> 24:18.650
If we hear anything,

24:18.930 --> 24:19.760
we'll leave at once.

24:20.210 --> 24:21.410
We can't drag them into this.

24:54.490 --> 24:55.280
I'll go get some water.

24:58.410 --> 24:59.080
Doesn't he look like him?

24:59.450 --> 25:00.360
I think so too.

25:00.490 --> 25:01.520
It's definitely him.

25:02.450 --> 25:03.450
I've never mistaken anyone.

25:03.800 --> 25:04.890
That is Magistrate Yan.

25:05.560 --> 25:06.280
Keep it down.

25:06.410 --> 25:07.360
Don't let them hear you.

25:08.040 --> 25:09.600
When we cook porridge for them later,

25:09.930 --> 25:10.360
we'll just...

25:22.560 --> 25:23.360
They've recognized you.

25:24.010 --> 25:24.360
Let's go.

25:25.120 --> 25:25.450
Wait.

25:26.560 --> 25:27.560
This is Lanyang territory.

25:27.930 --> 25:29.170
It's no surprise the locals know me.

25:29.730 --> 25:30.930
Even if they recognize me,

25:31.320 --> 25:32.760
that doesn't mean
they'll tell the pursuers.

25:33.760 --> 25:34.760
They clearly recognized you,

25:34.930 --> 25:35.730
yet they're still keeping it from you

25:36.280 --> 25:38.080
and plan to tamper with our food.

25:38.600 --> 25:39.520
What do you think they're planning?

25:41.170 --> 25:42.280
Are we really going to stake our lives

25:42.520 --> 25:43.650
on their conscience?

25:47.360 --> 25:47.800
Let's go.

26:15.450 --> 26:15.930
Sir.

26:16.690 --> 26:17.170
Eat up.

26:20.520 --> 26:22.170
Then get some rest early.

26:46.520 --> 26:47.040
Not poisoned.

26:53.320 --> 26:54.120
Hurry up and eat.

26:54.560 --> 26:56.560
Don't let them see
we're eating something different.

27:04.840 --> 27:05.360
Sir.

27:06.040 --> 27:06.560
What are you...?

27:14.840 --> 27:15.730
To be honest,

27:16.210 --> 27:16.970
that is all the rice

27:18.250 --> 27:19.450
we have left.

27:20.080 --> 27:21.250
Just enough for two bowls of porridge.

27:21.840 --> 27:22.890
We're old.

27:23.520 --> 27:24.170
We can't digest that.

27:24.760 --> 27:25.800
This is fine for us.

27:46.490 --> 27:46.760
Here.

27:47.600 --> 27:48.280
You two eat.

27:48.600 --> 27:49.690
We made it for you.

27:50.120 --> 27:50.760
We're not hungry.

27:51.800 --> 27:52.560
Have some more.

27:55.170 --> 27:57.170
I've been drinking this wild greens soup
since I was little.

27:59.760 --> 28:00.410
I'll try some too.

28:05.650 --> 28:06.760
I can tell this young lady

28:07.650 --> 28:09.080
comes from a wealthy family.

28:09.520 --> 28:10.520
She won't be used to it.

28:11.040 --> 28:11.600
I can handle it.

28:20.970 --> 28:21.520
Sir.

28:23.170 --> 28:24.600
You recognized me,

28:25.320 --> 28:26.600
so why didn't you tell us?

28:27.970 --> 28:28.560
Magistrate Yan,

28:30.040 --> 28:30.690
I

28:31.490 --> 28:32.520
may be old,

28:33.450 --> 28:34.930
but I can handle things.

28:36.690 --> 28:39.360
You and this young lady came
into the mountains late at night,

28:39.930 --> 28:41.930
covered in dirt

28:42.520 --> 28:43.490
and in such a hurry.

28:43.930 --> 28:44.490
I figured

28:44.890 --> 28:45.539
you must be

28:45.581 --> 28:47.991
in some trouble
you couldn't tell others about.

28:48.280 --> 28:49.690
I didn't want to pry.

28:51.450 --> 28:51.930
Thank you.

28:55.080 --> 28:55.600
I'm sorry.

28:59.490 --> 29:00.280
I kept things from you too.

29:07.520 --> 29:08.280
Magistrate Yan.

29:09.760 --> 29:10.970
Let me ask just one thing.

29:11.890 --> 29:13.080
Once you go down this mountain,

29:13.840 --> 29:15.280
you're out of Lanyang County.

29:15.560 --> 29:15.890
Are you

29:17.040 --> 29:18.080
really leaving?

29:18.800 --> 29:19.360
We're so sorry.

29:19.890 --> 29:20.520
Really.

29:21.080 --> 29:22.690
We have nothing to send you off with.

29:23.450 --> 29:24.690
You didn't even have your fill.

29:25.210 --> 29:25.760
We did.

29:27.250 --> 29:27.840
Thank you, ma'am.

29:28.650 --> 29:29.450
Magistrate Yan.

29:32.250 --> 29:33.560
Will you come back?

29:36.410 --> 29:37.730
The crops

29:39.360 --> 29:40.730
haven't even ripened yet this year.

29:43.010 --> 29:44.080
Enough.

29:46.120 --> 29:47.800
They must have
something important to do.

29:58.010 --> 29:58.650
This way!

29:59.250 --> 29:59.579
Everyone!

29:59.621 --> 30:00.549
Yes, sir!

30:00.591 --> 30:01.311
Don't let them get away!

30:01.360 --> 30:02.170
Search thoroughly!

30:04.930 --> 30:05.600
Over here!

30:06.250 --> 30:06.690
Coming!

30:06.970 --> 30:07.360
Coming! After them!

30:07.490 --> 30:08.059
They're closing in.

30:08.101 --> 30:08.541
Move it!

30:08.760 --> 30:09.170
Come on.

30:09.560 --> 30:10.210
You two, come with me.

30:10.410 --> 30:11.170
Hurry. Quick!

30:12.840 --> 30:13.120
Let's go.

30:13.210 --> 30:13.650
Come on.

30:13.840 --> 30:14.840
Get inside. Quick.

30:15.010 --> 30:15.280
Hurry.

30:15.730 --> 30:17.410
Lie down and pull the covers over you.

30:17.650 --> 30:18.280
Don't make a sound.

30:18.690 --> 30:20.560
Just pretend
you're my son and daughter-in-law.

30:20.890 --> 30:21.840
Stay in bed and keep quiet.

30:23.600 --> 30:24.210
Don't make a sound!

30:33.490 --> 30:34.120
Move it!

30:34.450 --> 30:34.930
Keep up!

30:35.450 --> 30:35.760
Hurry!

30:38.600 --> 30:40.250
A young couple in their twenties.

30:40.930 --> 30:41.410
Have you seen them?

30:41.890 --> 30:42.890
N-No, we haven't.

30:43.600 --> 30:45.600
We hardly see strangers around here.

30:45.970 --> 30:46.730
Is that so?

30:48.410 --> 30:49.410
We can't drag them into this.

30:52.280 --> 30:52.930
Out the window.

30:54.690 --> 30:55.040
- Let's go.
- Move aside!

31:10.650 --> 31:11.410
Who lives in this room?

31:13.280 --> 31:14.730
My son and daughter-in-law.

31:24.360 --> 31:25.280
Your son and daughter-in-law?

31:26.450 --> 31:26.890
Well,

31:27.040 --> 31:28.800
they usually live here.

31:29.170 --> 31:31.040
They went into town to buy goods today.

31:36.650 --> 31:37.080
Yan Shang.

31:37.410 --> 31:38.170
We have to split up.

31:38.360 --> 31:40.170
Your Highness, are you worried
they're after you

31:40.600 --> 31:41.279
and don't want to drag me down?

31:41.321 --> 31:41.891
What else?

31:42.210 --> 31:43.040
You're a minor official.

31:43.170 --> 31:44.040
Why would they search for you?

31:44.410 --> 31:44.800
Too late.

31:45.490 --> 31:47.170
Didn't you hear them ask
about two people?

31:47.840 --> 31:48.280
You and I

31:48.890 --> 31:49.600
are together.

31:51.320 --> 31:52.840
Someone's over there!
Everyone, follow me!

31:53.280 --> 31:53.930
Everyone, keep up!

31:54.120 --> 31:55.339
Yes, sir!

31:55.381 --> 31:55.951
Keep up!

31:57.170 --> 31:58.360
Hurry! Keep up!

31:58.450 --> 31:58.739
Keep up!

31:58.781 --> 31:59.581
I'm afraid

32:00.970 --> 32:01.970
I can't save you this time.

32:05.890 --> 32:06.890
Who goes there? Stop!

32:27.800 --> 32:28.120
Squad Leader.

32:29.450 --> 32:30.010
The portraits are here.

32:30.560 --> 32:31.520
Compare their faces.

33:10.930 --> 33:11.650
You live in the mountains?

33:13.490 --> 33:13.930
Yes.

33:14.650 --> 33:15.760
We're mountain folk.

33:16.210 --> 33:17.840
We were slow getting home today,

33:18.210 --> 33:18.909
so it got late.

33:18.951 --> 33:19.621
Nonsense!

33:20.040 --> 33:21.600
Coming home in the dead of night?

33:26.210 --> 33:27.560
Weren't those two old folks just now

33:28.760 --> 33:30.560
waiting for their son
and daughter-in-law to come home?

33:44.840 --> 33:45.890
Quit standing there!

33:46.210 --> 33:47.080
Keep searching!

33:48.560 --> 33:49.799
Then... what about these two...?

33:49.841 --> 33:50.691
Have you finished
searching everywhere else?

33:57.840 --> 33:58.170
Yes, sir.

33:59.490 --> 34:00.080
Keep searching!

34:01.010 --> 34:01.600
Yes, sir!

34:17.010 --> 34:17.640
Aren't you leaving?

34:18.160 --> 34:19.080
Why didn't you expose us?

34:28.930 --> 34:29.850
Forgive my rudeness just now.

34:30.520 --> 34:30.850
Your Highness.

34:32.040 --> 34:32.680
You recognize me?

34:33.520 --> 34:34.370
You are the Princess Regent.

34:39.040 --> 34:39.520
Rise.

34:44.450 --> 34:45.370
You have portraits.

34:45.930 --> 34:46.930
Why not compare our faces

34:47.520 --> 34:48.330
and turn us in for the reward?

34:48.720 --> 34:49.600
I know what you look like.

34:50.810 --> 34:51.680
No need for portraits.

34:54.040 --> 34:55.160
We've already searched this area.

34:55.970 --> 34:56.930
You can go down the mountain this way.

34:57.600 --> 34:58.560
You'll avoid the search parties.

35:01.490 --> 35:02.240
Why help us?

35:02.970 --> 35:03.930
Your Highness, you may not know me,

35:05.200 --> 35:06.330
but I could never forget you.

35:06.770 --> 35:07.640
In the 23rd year of Yingxiang,

35:08.120 --> 35:09.080
you ordered every military commander

35:09.810 --> 35:10.640
to bring a squad of soldiers

35:10.970 --> 35:12.450
to the capital for the assembly.

35:13.930 --> 35:14.600
I went along too.

35:15.160 --> 35:16.520
That's when I learned
you wanted to ask us

35:17.930 --> 35:19.080
whether back pay had been issued

35:19.560 --> 35:20.600
and whether our families
had been provided for.

35:21.680 --> 35:22.200
That's when I learned

35:23.040 --> 35:24.770
the order for garrison farming
to support the troops was from you.

35:26.160 --> 35:26.890
That year,

35:28.370 --> 35:29.770
I'd actually been ready to desert.

35:31.560 --> 35:33.520
But then our pay suddenly came through.

35:34.120 --> 35:35.200
So my parents didn't starve

35:36.680 --> 35:37.290
and I didn't become a bandit.

35:38.810 --> 35:39.240
Your Highness.

35:40.240 --> 35:41.640
We soldiers have only had enough to eat

35:42.560 --> 35:43.450
for the past three years.

35:44.720 --> 35:45.290
What's your name?

35:46.080 --> 35:47.290
I'm helping you for my own sake.

35:51.850 --> 35:52.850
I just want to live in peace.

35:53.810 --> 35:54.890
I don't want to be caught up
in another war.

35:56.810 --> 35:58.120
In the armies
across the prefectures and circuits,

35:59.810 --> 36:01.370
there are thousands of
insignificant soldiers

36:02.890 --> 36:03.680
like me.

36:18.040 --> 36:18.370
Let's go.

36:30.040 --> 36:30.410
Halt!

37:07.010 --> 37:07.520
Yang Si

37:08.160 --> 37:09.330
pays his respects to the Crown Prince!

37:10.970 --> 37:13.160
Welcome, Your Royal Highness!

37:48.520 --> 37:49.410
What is troubling you?

37:52.370 --> 37:53.160
At this point,

37:53.680 --> 37:54.370
is there anything

37:55.120 --> 37:56.080
we can't speak openly about?

37:56.640 --> 37:57.600
I'm just thinking

37:59.330 --> 38:01.330
the drought in Hannan and Hanbei

38:02.290 --> 38:03.450
and the other circuits hasn't eased yet.

38:04.160 --> 38:05.040
Raising troops now

38:05.240 --> 38:06.240
will throw the realm into chaos.

38:06.930 --> 38:09.010
The court's relief efforts
may not continue.

38:10.370 --> 38:11.120
Far more

38:11.600 --> 38:13.120
innocent people may die

38:13.890 --> 38:15.330
from natural disasters

38:16.120 --> 38:17.080
than on the battlefield.

38:17.450 --> 38:17.850
That's true.

38:18.450 --> 38:19.240
With natural disasters raging

38:19.560 --> 38:20.330
and public resentment boiling,

38:21.080 --> 38:22.490
the prefectures are already overwhelmed.

38:23.410 --> 38:24.330
This is the best time

38:25.290 --> 38:26.600
for me to raise troops.

38:26.810 --> 38:27.490
Heaven itself

38:28.490 --> 38:29.600
is on my side.

38:35.640 --> 38:36.330
Do you know

38:37.330 --> 38:37.930
where Wanyao is?

38:40.970 --> 38:41.520
I don't.

38:47.040 --> 38:48.160
Wanyao may be a woman,

38:49.600 --> 38:50.720
but she's not to be underestimated.

38:51.520 --> 38:53.450
With her in the picture,
anything could happen.

38:54.370 --> 38:55.330
Once I capture her,

38:56.330 --> 38:57.600
you can plead for her then.

38:59.680 --> 39:00.010
Alright.

39:01.370 --> 39:02.930
Go bring Wang Chengding
and Tan Yuanchun in.

39:03.890 --> 39:05.040
We need to discuss

39:05.970 --> 39:06.890
our marching strategy.

39:07.290 --> 39:07.810
Your Highness.

39:08.890 --> 39:09.579
Is there

39:09.621 --> 39:10.831
really no other way?

39:24.080 --> 39:24.770
To think

39:25.450 --> 39:26.450
you're still this naive

39:27.930 --> 39:29.370
after all this time.

39:29.890 --> 39:30.450
Your Highness.

39:31.720 --> 39:33.410
Whenever I think of the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors,

39:34.330 --> 39:35.560
it feels like it happened yesterday.

39:35.970 --> 39:38.080
The realm has only enjoyed
a few years of peace...

39:38.370 --> 39:39.160
Yang Si!

39:39.810 --> 39:41.450
We've already raised troops.

39:43.370 --> 39:44.640
There's no turning back.

39:46.890 --> 39:48.680
If we back down now,

39:49.010 --> 39:50.810
everyone out there dies!

39:52.850 --> 39:54.040
If they don't want to die,

39:54.450 --> 39:55.970
they'll have to kill you and me first!

39:57.080 --> 39:58.930
We have no other choice.

39:59.520 --> 40:00.080
Yang Si,

40:00.520 --> 40:01.970
look at me now.

40:04.970 --> 40:06.240
I've been confined for three years.

40:07.040 --> 40:08.770
Every day was sheer torture.

40:09.490 --> 40:10.810
But I survived.

40:11.450 --> 40:12.560
Because this throne

40:12.930 --> 40:13.640
and this realm

40:14.240 --> 40:16.930
are what I've sacrificed everything

40:17.080 --> 40:19.290
and schemed half my life for!

40:19.770 --> 40:21.770
I am Huai's rightful heir.

40:24.080 --> 40:24.970
But now,

40:25.370 --> 40:26.219
the throne is about

40:26.261 --> 40:27.911
to fall to that fool, the Prince of Jin!

40:28.490 --> 40:29.040
Tell me,

40:30.330 --> 40:31.680
how can I accept that?

40:38.640 --> 40:40.410
I'm just taking back

40:41.330 --> 40:43.330
what he stole from me.

40:45.040 --> 40:46.200
That's all.

40:52.240 --> 40:52.680
Any

40:54.770 --> 40:55.810
more questions?

41:16.520 --> 41:17.600
When did you learn to ride?

41:20.450 --> 41:22.450
It's been three years.
I had to pick up a few skills.

41:23.040 --> 41:23.810
Lanyang may be small,

41:24.040 --> 41:25.370
but it's still too big
to get around on foot.

41:26.240 --> 41:26.850
Riding a horse

41:27.370 --> 41:28.560
isn't much different
from riding a donkey.

41:32.080 --> 41:32.970
Where are we now?

41:33.810 --> 41:34.850
We've passed Mount Xiao.

41:35.520 --> 41:37.010
Another two or three days,
and we'll reach the capital.

41:39.640 --> 41:42.010
Along the way, the prefectures
and counties have been quiet.

41:42.640 --> 41:43.010
Either

41:43.410 --> 41:45.120
we've left the rebels behind,

41:45.600 --> 41:46.010
or...

41:46.640 --> 41:47.410
They've turned their coat.

41:56.330 --> 41:57.720
How did he escape?

41:58.290 --> 41:59.200
That's impossible.

42:00.160 --> 42:01.389
He's been locked up for three years.

42:01.431 --> 42:03.581
He's practically lost his mind.

42:05.160 --> 42:06.930
(Universe in Harmony)
Did he grow wings and fly away?

42:07.680 --> 42:09.200
And end up at the Jinwu Guard's camp?

42:10.560 --> 42:12.640
Speak! Cat got your tongue?

42:14.930 --> 42:15.640
Calm down, Your Highness.

42:17.240 --> 42:17.720
Everyone out.

42:19.010 --> 42:19.389
Yes.

42:19.431 --> 42:21.181
What exactly happened?

42:21.290 --> 42:21.640
Your Highness.

42:22.520 --> 42:23.560
I've got to the bottom of it.

42:24.040 --> 42:24.770
Then say it!

42:25.080 --> 42:27.770
The former palace eunuchs
from the Eastern Palace joined forces

42:28.120 --> 42:29.810
to help the deposed Crown Prince escape
to the Jinwu Guard.

42:30.330 --> 42:31.080
The deposed Crown Prince

42:31.450 --> 42:33.720
had put a lot of effort
into the Jinwu Guard's left camp.

42:34.450 --> 42:36.080
And now he's colluded with rebels there,

42:36.490 --> 42:37.240
left the capital overnight,

42:37.600 --> 42:38.200
and headed south.

42:41.410 --> 42:42.640
He ran?

42:46.200 --> 42:47.490
Good!

42:50.200 --> 42:51.970
I thought he was planning something.

42:53.160 --> 42:56.120
That guy always looked down on me.

42:56.720 --> 42:57.789
Three years in prison

42:57.831 --> 42:59.701
must have scared him out of his wits.

42:59.970 --> 43:01.080
All he wants is to save his own skin.

43:02.810 --> 43:05.930
Turns out he's nothing but a coward.

43:08.640 --> 43:11.770
You always say
you've got everything handled.

43:12.810 --> 43:14.450
Something this serious happened,

43:14.970 --> 43:16.410
and you knew nothing about it?

43:21.080 --> 43:21.970
Once I...

43:22.490 --> 43:22.810
Wait!

43:24.850 --> 43:25.370
The first thing

43:26.330 --> 43:27.330
I'll do

43:28.040 --> 43:29.490
after taking the throne

43:30.080 --> 43:31.890
is hunt down that traitor,

43:32.200 --> 43:32.770
Mu Xun!

43:33.450 --> 43:35.040
Report!

43:35.850 --> 43:36.200
Your Highness!

43:36.330 --> 43:37.080
What now?

43:37.810 --> 43:38.770
(Universe in Harmony)
The capital garrison reports

43:39.040 --> 43:40.240
that the deposed Crown Prince has left
the capital with his troops.

43:40.330 --> 43:42.720
He's joined forces with the rebel armies
from Handong and Hanbei!

43:43.290 --> 43:44.240
Now he's turned west.

43:44.680 --> 43:46.970
He may be planning to take
the Tongguan route back to Sheng'an!

43:48.450 --> 43:49.490
He's coming back?

43:50.080 --> 43:50.810
What should we do?

43:51.080 --> 43:51.850
Your orders, please!

43:57.290 --> 43:57.720
What's the panic?

43:58.200 --> 43:58.560
Get out!

43:59.240 --> 43:59.560
Yes!

44:02.330 --> 44:02.810
Mr. Liu.

44:04.040 --> 44:05.200
You have to save me.

44:06.120 --> 44:06.770
He's coming back...

44:07.450 --> 44:08.909
He's coming back to take my throne!

44:08.951 --> 44:10.951
He... he's going to kill me!

44:13.930 --> 44:14.330
Alright.

44:15.240 --> 44:15.890
I won't take

44:16.450 --> 44:17.330
the throne.

44:17.890 --> 44:18.520
I'll... I'll...

44:18.640 --> 44:20.600
I'll just give it back to him!

44:30.970 --> 44:31.450
Your Highness.

44:33.810 --> 44:34.930
At this point,

44:36.640 --> 44:37.890
you have no choice.

44:39.720 --> 44:41.330
You're going to be the Emperor

44:42.410 --> 44:43.160
whether you like it

44:43.930 --> 44:44.970
or not.

44:45.890 --> 44:46.970
If you ascend the throne first,

44:47.640 --> 44:48.770
he'll be a traitor.

44:49.520 --> 44:50.930
But if the Eastern Palace is restored,

44:52.080 --> 44:53.330
you'll be the traitor.

44:54.720 --> 44:55.450
Between you and him,

44:56.640 --> 44:57.520
only one gets to survive!

44:59.010 --> 44:59.520
Understand?

45:02.970 --> 45:04.160
The coronation will be tomorrow.

45:04.850 --> 45:05.450
Keep it simple.

45:08.490 --> 45:09.200
By order of the Crown Prince,

45:09.600 --> 45:11.970
the Shence Army shall assemble at once
and march to Tongguan

45:12.520 --> 45:13.490
to crush the rebels!

45:14.640 --> 45:15.770
The deposed Crown Prince, Mu Xun,

45:16.410 --> 45:17.520
is ruthless

45:17.850 --> 45:18.640
and seeks to destroy the realm.

45:19.200 --> 45:20.240
His head must be hung
at the palace gates

45:20.890 --> 45:21.970
to uphold the law!

45:24.780 --> 45:28.820
(Next Episode Preview)

45:29.200 --> 45:30.240
I urge Your Majesty

45:30.810 --> 45:34.040
and the Retired Emperor
to go south at once.

45:34.240 --> 45:34.680
I,

45:35.520 --> 45:36.930
Yan Shang, Magistrate of Lanyang,

45:38.370 --> 45:40.200
volunteer to defend Sheng'an.

45:45.681 --> 45:48.974
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:51.659 --> 45:56.575
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:58.769 --> 46:04.614
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

46:05.114 --> 46:10.340
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:13.109 --> 46:17.900
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:18.736 --> 46:24.815
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:26.616 --> 46:29.766
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:29.766 --> 46:31.414
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:31.466 --> 46:35.190
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:35.568 --> 46:40.234
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:40.853 --> 46:44.894
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:45.385 --> 46:47.500
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:47.540 --> 46:54.486
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

46:55.249 --> 46:58.702
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:58.882 --> 47:02.027
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

47:02.466 --> 47:09.103
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:09.500 --> 47:11.538
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:11.538 --> 47:14.014
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:14.052 --> 47:16.521
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:16.725 --> 47:23.612
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:23.924 --> 47:27.195
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:27.500 --> 47:30.673
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:30.997 --> 47:34.423
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:34.656 --> 47:37.881
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:38.212 --> 47:45.008
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:45.377 --> 47:47.439
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:47.440 --> 47:49.943
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:49.990 --> 47:52.328
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:52.559 --> 47:59.394
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:59.743 --> 48:01.361
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

48:01.491 --> 48:03.287
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

48:03.644 --> 48:06.661
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:06.701 --> 48:08.028
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
